  "bodyHash": "RuCaYQWyUVg=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>需先安裝：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen 16x</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mobs-refreshed-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mobs Refreshed</a></span></strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Fasten 是一個模組相容性資源包，旨在為 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fear-nightfall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fear Nightfall</a></span> 整合包中的多個模組與 Ashen 16x 資源包提供相容性支援</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>相容的模組列表：</strong></span></span></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>天空維度（The Aether）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>深淵再臨（Deep Dark Regrowth）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>農夫樂（Farmers Delight）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>恐怖元素模組（Horror elements Mod）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>沉浸工程（Immersive Engineering）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>突變怪物（Mutant Monsters）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>夸克（Quark）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>附屬品（Supplementaries）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>旅者背包（Travelers Backpacks）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>廢墟（Derelict）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>以及更多</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>範例：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>苦力怕僕從現在使用 Fresh Animations 和 Mobs Refreshed 的苦力怕模型與材質</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>突變苦力怕現在使用基於 Mobs Refreshed 苦力怕的材質（其他突變怪物與對應原版怪物的處理方式相同）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>原版水桶及所有水桶變體都擁有修改版的 Ashen 水桶材質，以兼容沉浸工程的水桶格式並保持所有水桶類型的一致性</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>所有骷髏方塊模型現在使用 Mobs Refreshed 的正確模型與材質</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>廢墟模組中所有閃爍和熄滅的方塊現在使用 Ashen 的正確材質與模型</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>以及更多</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>所有新的材質與模型均由我修改，但非原創，所有功勞歸屬於各自對應材質/模型的模組開發者與資源包作者</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aim__boot/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Aim_Boot：Ashen 16x 開發者</strong></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>FreshXL：Fresh Animations 開發者</strong></span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lukidon/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>lukidon：Mobs Refreshed 開發者</strong></span></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
